  "title": "Ham and Pineapple Couscous Salad",
  "description": "Toss buttered and seasoned couscous with cubes of ham, pineapple chunks, sweet red onions and green peas. Serve with a tangy dressing of pineapple juice and Dijon mustard for a light, refreshing salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Julie Stutzman"
